- op: discuss  # 6071
  at: '2026-05-20T02:01:20Z'  # 6071
  by: agent  # 6071
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6071
  clock: 4  # 6071
  nonce: '6071'  # 6071
  message: "INV-morag PR 1 merged as PR #3834. Lands two additive provenance fields (option A: AnalysisRun.pass_version via sha256 of pass module source; option B: behavior_map['reproducibility_context'] with L2 capture + explicit L3-L5 disclaim). No rename yet — PR 2 will propagate non-empty pass_version values to every registration site and drop the legacy -v1 suffix from pass IDs. 14 new property tests; 11136 tests pass; 100% coverage. The L2 capture is honest about what hypergumbo records and what it disclaims: not_captured array enumerates transitive pip deps, OS/kernel/libc/locale/env vars, and hardware (CPU model, microcode, fp determinism). Two follow-up CI fixes required to land: stale ARCHITECTURE.md regenerated (14 commits drift, unrelated), and pragma:no cover on two defensive branches in _detect_tree_sitter_versions (tree-sitter PackageNotFoundError + dist with empty Name)."  # 6071
